<concept id="t00224">
	<title>Power tailgate opening speed</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>To adjust the power tailgate speed, select <menucascade><uicontrol outputclass="a1701754">Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol outputclass="a1701772">Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Door</uicontrol><uicontrol outputclass="a1804724">Power tailgate Opening Speed</uicontrol><uicontrol>Normal/Fast</uicontrol></menucascade> in the infotainment system. (Default setting is <term>Fast</term>)</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>